---
description: Never log bodies, prompts, tokens, zrok share tokens, or SSH keys
alwaysApply: true
---

# Sensitivity

Treat proxied Ollama traffic and cloud credentials as secrets.

**Never log or persist:** request/response bodies, prompts, embeddings, `/api/chat`
messages, Verda access/refresh tokens or client secrets, `RUNPOD_API_KEY`,
SSH private keys, zrok share tokens, `OLLAMA_ROUTER_ADMIN_TOKEN`, capacity bearer tokens.

**Allowlist:** node id, model name, request class, status code, latency, reason
codes (`no_healthy`, `saturated`, `public_url_blocked`), instance type, location,
spot price, VRAM GiB.

SQLite job store (`/var/lib/ollama-router/model-operations.sqlite3`) keeps
operation id, kind, status, timestamps, normalized models/nodes, per-target
status. Upstream bodies and per-target `detail` strings stay memory-only.

```rust
// BAD
tracing::info!(body = %payload, token = %access_token, "verda create");

// GOOD
tracing::info!(instance_type, location_code, spot_price, vram_gb, "verda create");
```
